---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Overdott Technologies"
  description="Draft privacy notice for Overdott Technologies Limited website enquiries. Review before publication."
>
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-simple">
    <div class="page-width page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy · Draft for review</p>
        <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
        <p>This draft explains how website enquiry information may be handled. Review it against actual business practices and applicable Kenyan law before publication.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-compact page-width privacy-layout">
    <article class="article-body privacy-body">
      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>If you send an enquiry, the website collects the information entered, which may include your name, organization, email, phone number, service interest, message, preferred contact method and privacy acknowledgement.</p>

      <h2>How information is used</h2>
      <p>Information may be used to review and respond to your enquiry, communicate about a potential engagement and maintain appropriate business records. Do not send passwords, payment details or unnecessary sensitive personal information through the form.</p>

      <h2>Service providers and transfers</h2>
      <p>On PHP hosting, the contact form uses the default PHP enquiry handler. Netlify Forms may be used instead when configured. Confirm the selected provider, processing terms, storage locations, retention settings and any cross-border transfers before publication. Update this section if other form, hosting, analytics or communications providers are introduced.</p>

      <h2>Retention and security</h2>
      <p>Information should be retained only for a defined business or legal purpose and protected with appropriate administrative and technical measures. The retention period and procedures need confirmation before publication.</p>

      <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>Describe the rights and request process that apply under relevant privacy laws, including how to ask about, access, correct or request deletion of personal information. Publish a working privacy contact before launch.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This initial implementation does not intentionally include analytics or advertising trackers. Review production hosting and future third-party tools; add required consent controls before enabling technologies that need them.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions or requests, email <a href="mailto:info@overdott.com">info@overdott.com</a>. Confirm that this mailbox is monitored and publish the request process before launch.</p>
    </article>

    <aside class="privacy-aside" aria-label="Privacy review summary">
      <div class="note-box">
        <p><strong>Publication note:</strong> This is a starting draft, not legal advice. Confirm the responsible legal entity, lawful basis, retention period, processors, security procedures and data-subject rights process. Seek qualified Kenyan privacy review before launch.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="eyebrow">In brief</p>
      <ul class="privacy-summary">
        <li><strong>Information:</strong> Details you provide through website enquiries.</li>
        <li><strong>Use:</strong> Responding to enquiries and maintaining appropriate business records.</li>
        <li><strong>Before publication:</strong> Confirm providers, retention, security and rights processes.</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>